_model: definition
---
title: Definition 10
---
order: 10
---
short_label: I.Def.10
---
statement: When a straight line standing on a straight line makes the adjacent angles equal to one another, each of the equal angles is <i>right,</i> and the straight line standing on the other is called a <i>perpendicular</i> to that on which it stands.
---
